                  exemplar: "Problem Based Learning: Brain-write, think-square-share or brainstorm to explain in own words the concept resources with specific examples of resources for everyday living.\nExample: Resources are all the materials available to individuals and their environment which are technologically accessible, economically feasible and culturally sustainable that help to satisfy their needs, wants and achieve goals. These resources include time, energy, money, skills and equipment, etc.",
